</header>

<section id="ranking" style="margin-top:-24px">
  <p class="muted">Each parameter is scored 0–10 and weighted, then summed to 100. Switch the lens to see how the ranking changes depending on what you care about most.</p>
  <div class="lenses" role="group" aria-label="Weighting lens">
    <button class="lens" id="lens-balanced" data-lens="balanced" aria-pressed="true">Balanced</button>
    <button class="lens" id="lens-clinical" data-lens="clinical" aria-pressed="false">Clinical &amp; PG first</button>
    <button class="lens" id="lens-hyd" data-lens="hyd" aria-pressed="false">Hyderabad &amp; brand first</button>
  </div>
